    "teach_6": {
      "id": "teach_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Sometimes the question asks how many rounds occurred.\n\nIf a 16 L vessel loses 4 L each round, retention factor is 3/4.\n\nAfter n rounds, original fraction = (3/4)^n.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_6_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_6_step": {
      "id": "teach_6_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "If the final original fraction is 27/64, recognise 27/64 = (3/4)^3.\n\nSo n=3.\n\nPattern recognition can avoid logarithms when the numbers are designed as simple powers.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_6"
        }
      ]
    },
